    <section class="faq-section" id="volufiline-section"><h2>Volufiline</h2><div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="volufiline" id="question-1">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Volufiline</span><span class="faq-question">What type of product is Volufiline 100% Concentrate?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>CELDYQUE Volufiline 100% Concentrate is an oil-based mix-in concentrate. Mix 1–2 drops with a compatible cream, lotion or serum, following your product label.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-volufiline-100'].url }}">Volufiline 100% Concentrate</a></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="volufiline" id="question-2">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Volufiline</span><span class="faq-question">How do I use Volufiline 100% Concentrate?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Mix 1-2 drops with your cream, lotion or serum in your palm, following the product directions. Do not add it to a sunscreen or to the full container of another product. Avoid direct contact with eyes and lips. Patch test before use and stop if irritation occurs.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-volufiline-100'].url }}">Volufiline 100% Concentrate</a></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="volufiline" id="question-3">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Volufiline</span><span class="faq-question">How soon will I see results from Volufiline?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Visible results vary with skin, routine and consistency. We do not promise a specific volume increase or a fixed results timeline for this finished product. Ingredient research is not a guarantee of the same result from an individual skincare routine.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-volufiline-100'].url }}">Volufiline 100% Concentrate</a></div>
      </details>
    </div></section>
    <section class="faq-section" id="pdrn-section"><h2>PDRN</h2><div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="pdrn" id="question-4">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">PDRN</span><span class="faq-question">How do the three CELDYQUE PDRN products differ?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Choose by format and routine step: the collection includes a gel-type concentrate, a serum applied before moisturizer and a cream used as the moisturizer step. A product-name percentage alone does not determine which formula fits your routine.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-pdrn-25'].url }}">PDRN 250,000ppm Concentrate</a></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="pdrn" id="question-5">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">PDRN</span><span class="faq-question">Should I choose the PDRN serum or cream?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The PDRN 12% + EGF Peptide Serum is a serum step, while the PDRN 12% + EGF Peptide Cream is a moisturizer step. Choose the texture that fits your existing routine and follow the directions for that formula.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-pdrn-12-egf-peptide-serum-30-ml'].url }}">PDRN 12% + EGF Peptide Serum</a></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="pdrn" id="question-6">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">PDRN</span><span class="faq-question">Can I use PDRN skincare after microneedling or a procedure?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>These products are topical cosmetics, not injectable products or wound treatments. Do not apply to broken skin. After a procedure, ask the treating clinician when you can resume cosmetics and which products are appropriate.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-pdrn-12-egf-cream'].url }}">PDRN 12% + EGF Peptide Cream</a></div>
      </details>
    </div></section>
    <section class="faq-section" id="peptides-section"><h2>Peptides</h2><div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="peptides" id="question-7">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Peptides</span><span class="faq-question">What is Blue Copper Peptide Bakuchiol Serum?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>CELDYQUE Blue Copper Peptide Bakuchiol Serum is a face serum applied after cleansing and toning, before moisturizer. Read the full ingredient list on your packaging.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-blue-copper-peptide-bakuchiol-serum'].url }}">Blue Copper Peptide Bakuchiol Serum</a></div>
