    <section class="faq-section" id="niacinamide-section"><h2>Niacinamide</h2><div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="niacinamide" id="question-8">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Niacinamide</span><span class="faq-question">How should I introduce Niacinamide 20% Pore Minimizer Serum?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Follow the amount and frequency on your packaging. Introduce it gradually and avoid adding several unfamiliar products at once.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-niacinamide-20-advanced'].url }}">Niacinamide 20% Pore Minimizer Serum</a></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="niacinamide" id="question-9">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Niacinamide</span><span class="faq-question">Can I combine Niacinamide 20% with other active products?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Compatibility depends on the complete formulas and your skin, not only the ingredient names. Introduce one new product at a time. Avoid starting several high-concentration products together, and ask a dermatologist about a routine involving prescription treatments.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-niacinamide-20-advanced'].url }}">Niacinamide 20% Pore Minimizer Serum</a></div>
      </details>
    </div></section>
