      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="bakuchiol" id="question-12">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Bakuchiol</span><span class="faq-question">Is bakuchiol skincare guaranteed safe during pregnancy or breastfeeding?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>We do not claim pregnancy or breastfeeding safety for these finished formulas. Ask your healthcare professional to review the complete ingredient list before use. A plant-derived ingredient or a retinol-alternative label is not a safety guarantee.</p><a href="{{ all_products['test-celdyque-bakuchiol-volume-collagen-cream'].url }}">Bakuchiol Volume Collagen Cream</a></div>
