      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="tone" id="question-13">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Tone &amp; Glow</span><span class="faq-question">How do ArbutXA Glow Cream and Glutathione Glow Serum differ?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
