      <details class="faq-item" data-cat="cleansing" id="question-14">
        <summary class="faq-header"><span class="faq-category">Cleansing</span><span class="faq-question">How are Cleansing Oil and Gentle Cleanser used?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
